{"id":"d6bef7860773e31d","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-stage-enumeration.md","title":"有限阶段枚举","display":"df-stage-enumeration — 有限阶段枚举","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-stage-enumeration","aliases":["43-df-stage-enumeration"],"display":"df-stage-enumeration — 有限阶段枚举","depends_on":["[[43-df-oracle-computation]]","[[43-df-ce]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§5.2, print pp.10–11 / PDF pp.30–31","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"definition-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-stage-enumeration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-stage-enumeration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-stage-enumeration — 有限阶段枚举"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4400f4836786a4bd\" href=\"?note=4400f4836786a4bd\" title=\"43-df-oracle-computation\">43-df-oracle-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§5.2, print pp.10–11 / PDF pp.30–31"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,s\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e,s\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；执行原语Exec见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4400f4836786a4bd\" href=\"?note=4400f4836786a4bd\" title=\"43-df-oracle-computation\">43-df-oracle-computation</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"W_{e,s}:=\\{x\\in\\mathbb N:x\\le s\\land\\exists t\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists Q\\in[\\mathbb N]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(t\\le s\\land\\operatorname{Exec}(e,\\varnothing,x,t,y,Q))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[W_{e,s}:=\\{x\\in\\mathbb N:x\\le s\\land\\exists t\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists Q\\in[\\mathbb N]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(t\\le s\\land\\operatorname{Exec}(e,\\varnothing,x,t,y,Q))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"W_{e,0}\\subseteq W_{e,1}\\subseteq\\cdots,\\qquad W_e=\\bigcup_sW_{e,s}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[W_{e,0}\\subseteq W_{e,1}\\subseteq\\cdots,\\qquad W_e=\\bigcup_sW_{e,s}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每阶段的集合有限且一致可判定，单调逼近标准c.e.集；机器以输入与步数双重界限模拟。</p>\n<p>来源：§5.2, print pp.10–11 / PDF pp.30–31。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"4400f4836786a4bd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-oracle-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"4400f4836786a4bd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$e,s\\in\\mathbb N$；执行原语Exec见 [[43-df-oracle-computation]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"e,s\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"W_{e,s}:=\\{x\\in\\mathbb N:x\\le s\\land\\exists t\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists Q\\in[\\mathbb N]^{<\\omega}\\;(t\\le s\\land\\operatorname{Exec}(e,\\varnothing,x,t,y,Q))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"W_{e,0}\\subseteq W_{e,1}\\subseteq\\cdots,\\qquad W_e=\\bigcup_sW_{e,s}.","display":true}],"bytes":1107,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-stage-enumeration]] — 有限阶段枚举"},{"id":"d2a7ec8c3ff53d91","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-pi01class]]、[[43-df-effective-open]]、[[43-df-stage-enumeration]]。"}],"outgoing":["4400f4836786a4bd","6c0559518cd32104"]}